---
import heroImage from "../assets/images/heroImage.svg?url"
import heroBackground from "../assets/images/heroBackground.svg?url"
---

<section class="lg:flex lg:justify-between lg:flex-row-reverse lg:items-center lg:px-10">
  <div class="relative h-145 lg:flex-2">
    <img class="w-full h-170 max-w-xl max-h-xl relative bottom-25 sm:max-w-none lg:h-151 lg:max-h-none lg:max-w-none lg:-bottom-5" src={heroBackground} loading="lazy">
    <picture>
      <source srcset="" media="(min-width: 1024px)"/>
      <img class="absolute top-7 left-0 w-130 h-130 sm:left-36 md:left-50 lg:left-62 lg:w-140 lg:h-144" src={heroImage} alt="Dentista revisando los dientes de un paciente" loading="lazy"/>
    </picture>
  </div>
  <div class="px-5 flex flex-col gap-y-5 lg:flex-1">
    <span class=" text-primary-blue font-normal">En Cordoba Capital</span>
    <h1 class="text-dark-blue text-3xl font-semibold w-80 leading-12 lg:text-5xl lg:w-90 lg:leading-16">Una excelente experiencia <span class="text-blue">Odontológica</span></h1>
    <p class="text-primary-black leading-6">
      Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipiscing elit molestie, rhoncus luctus arcu ut eros augue. Eu commodo laoreet parturient quam purus magna pretium luctus.
    </p>
    <div class=" flex justify-between">
      <button class="px-6 py-3 bg-blue rounded-lg text-primary-white font-medium shadow-[3px_3px_#2977d5]">Saca tu turno</button>
      <button class="rounded-lg border-1 border-gray-500 px-4 py-3">Nuestros Servicios</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>